# The vcpkg port describes the release archive, so it must not be part of
# it. Excluding it here breaks the circular dependency: the port's SHA512
# is the hash of a tarball that does not change when the portfile
# changes.
#
# Without this, publishing a corrected hash would change the tarball it
# describes, and the port would be broken for every installer.
vcpkg/portfile.cmake export-ignore
vcpkg.json export-ignore
